er Downloads.</p></div></div></li><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Klik dua kali <code class="er4J8W_Code" data-d-component="code">mlbb_match_overlay.html</code>.</p></div></div></li><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">File akan terbuka di browser.</p></div></div></li><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Edit skor dan nama tim melalui panel kiri. Preview di sebelah kanan akan berubah langsung.</p></div></div></li><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Klik <span class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Mode overlay</span> untuk menyembunyikan panel editor.</p></div></div></li></ol><h2 class="w6asjq_TextBase GgxHUa_Title" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold">2. Cara membuatnya menjadi website online</h2><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Kalau kamu ingin overlay mempunyai URL yang bisa dibuka dari perangkat lain:</p><ol class="PSWZZq_List" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="number" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Buka <span class="oIb9lq_Box" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-inline=""><a class="Uwo0ZW_Link" data-d-component="link" rel="noopener" target="_blank" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" role="link" tabindex="0" href="https://github.com/" style="overflow-wrap: normal; white-space: nowrap;"><span class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" data-d-text-decoration="underline-dotted" style="color: inherit;">GitHub</span><span aria-hidden="true"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" data-rtl-flip="" data-d-component="icon" data-d-inline="" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: text-bottom;"><path d="M16.2256 6.99994C16.6534 7 17 7.34654 17 7.77436V14.817C17 15.2449 16.6534 15.5914 16.2256 15.5915C15.7977 15.5915 15.4512 15.2449 15.4512 14.817V9.6437L8.32182 16.773C8.0193 17.0756 7.52944 17.0755 7.2269 16.773C6.92437 16.4705 6.92437 15.9807 7.2269 15.6781L14.3562 8.54878H9.1829C8.75505 8.54878 8.40848 8.20221 8.40848 7.77436C8.40848 7.34651 8.75505 6.99994 9.1829 6.99994H16.2256Z"></path></svg></span></a></span> dan buat repository baru.</p></div></div></li><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Upload file HTML tadi, lalu ubah namanya menjadi <code class="er4J8W_Code" data-d-component="code">index.html</code>.</p></div></div></li><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Buka <span class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Settings â†’ Pages</span>.</p></div></div></li><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Pilih branch utama sebagai sumber deployment dan simpan.</p></div></div></li><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Setelah proses selesai, GitHub Pages akan memberikan URL website kamu.</p></div></div></li></ol><h2 class="w6asjq_TextBase GgxHUa_Title" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold">3. Kalau mau dipakai untuk live streaming</h2><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Buka OBS Studio, lalu:</p><ol class="PSWZZq_List" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="number" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Tambahkan sumber <span class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Browser</span>.</p></div></div></li><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div