uto-spacing="" data-d-component="row" data-d-direction="row" style="flex: 0 0 auto;"><span class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-size="3xs" data-d-inline="" style="color: var(--color-text-tertiary);">+1</span></div></div></div></span></span></div></span></span></p></div></div></div><h2 class="w6asjq_TextBase GgxHUa_Title" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold">Penting sebelum kamu live</h2><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">File yang sekarang saya buat masih memiliki panel editor dan latar hitam. Jadi, <span class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">jangan langsung menggunakannya sebagai overlay final</span>, karena panel editor bisa ikut tampil dan latar hitam bisa menutupi game.</p><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Overlay final sebaiknya punya dua halaman:</p><ul class="PSWZZq_List" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="bullet" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Halaman admin:</span> untuk mengubah skor, nama tim, jadwal, dan status pertandingan.</p></div></div></li><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Halaman overlay:</span> hanya menampilkan kartu pertandingan dengan latar transparan.</p></div></div></li></ul><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Keduanya perlu dihubungkan agar perubahan skor dari halaman admin ikut tampil di TikTok LIVE Studio.</p><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Mau saya buatkan versi dua halaman tersebut, khusus untuk TikTok LIVE Studio, supaya kamu bisa mengedit skor tanpa memperlihatkan panel admin kepada penonton?</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Tindakan respons" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Salin respons" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [